<</Title(pi = partition\(arr, low, high\)         quick_sort\(arr, low, pi - 1\)         quick_sort\(arr, pi + 1, high\) # Take input from the user n = int\(input\("Enter the number of elements: "\)\) arr = [] print\("Enter the elements:"\) for i in range\(n\):     arr.append\(int\(input\(\)\)\) # Measure execution time start_time = time.perf_counter\(\) quick_sort\(arr, 0, n - 1\) end_time = time.perf_counter\(\))/Dest[20 0 R/Fit]/Parent 366 0 R/Next 708 0 R>>
